# {{ api_title }}

Auto-generated REST API from Excel data.

## Quick Start

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python seed_data.py
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

Then open [http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs](http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs) to see the interactive API documentation.

## Docker

```bash
docker build -t generated-api .
docker run -p 8000:8000 generated-api
```

